\par 1.  \cf0  No other name greater than Jesus
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 in the realm and on the earth
\par angels and men keep worship Him
\par and the devil dislike Him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. No other name greater than Jesus
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 to us Adam descendants
\par in Him we shall find forgiveness
\par in His name shall we be blessed.
\par \pard\f1 
